    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "World Bee Day "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on May 20 every year. This special day "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "highlights",
            "ref": "v-highlight"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the importance of bees and beekeeping. Do you know just how "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these little insects are to our planet?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bees are very important for our food. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pollinate",
            "zh": "为……授粉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about 75 per cent of the world’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "major",
            "ref": "v-major"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " crops, including many fruits and vegetables we eat every day. The insects help to keep the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between life forms and their environment. They help plants grow and make seeds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, scientists say bees are now in more "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " than before. They face "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like climate change, diseases and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "habitat",
            "ref": "v-habitat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " loss. According to the United Nations, about one thousand bee "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "species",
            "ref": "v-species"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are facing "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extinction",
            "ref": "v-extinction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for our world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What can we do to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bees then? Well, bees eat "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "nectar",
            "zh": "花蜜"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In cities, most nectar comes from gardens and backyards. You can grow more flowers and other plants in your balcony garden or backyard. Don’t cut the grass too short. Don’t use "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pesticides",
            "ref": "v-pesticide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " too "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Let the plants grow wild. Don’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " insects’ nests when you see them. This way, you can make your balcony or backyard a good place for bees! These small "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " can help protect these important insects."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
